        "content": "{\"text\": \"原始消息元数据：{\\\"id\\\": \\\"slack_old_freq\\\", \\\"channel_id\\\": \\\"ch_social_ops\\\", \\\"user_id\\\": \\\"U_MKTG_OPS\\\", \\\"ts\\\": \\\"2026-01-20T10:00:00Z\\\"}\\nWeekly social scheduling reminder: we target 3 posts per channel per week. Schedule all approved content for any day of the week including weekends. Sunday posts are fine if you have approved content ready. See the email thread for our full posting-days guidance.\"}"
      },
